          "reason": "BMW is aggressively executing a multi-year share buyback program, repurchasing over 300,000 shares in the first week of September alone. While China remains a headwind, the stock's multi-year low valuation is viewed as an overreaction by major analysts (e.g., Goldman Sachs), and its flexible drivetrain strategy provides long-term optionality.",
