          "reason": "Berenberg upgraded BMW to Buy with a €75 target from €69, arguing the June China-driven profit warning created a sounder earnings base ahead of the late-September capital markets day. The stock rose about 2.3% to roughly €63.6 even as BlackRock added to its net short, a notable show of underlying demand.",
