            "execution_status": "SUCCESS",
            "provider": "xai",
            "rank": 1,
            "reason": "Recent 5-day gain of ~4% and daily volume surge signal technical recovery from €56-60 lows. Citi catalyst watch and Sept 30 CMD provide near-term attention without relying on unconfirmed operational beats.",
